Relevant columns and how they could be used  
(only columns from the seven allowed tables are referenced)

• `repository_dependencies.dependency_project_name` : name of the dependency to match against the feature‑toggle list  
• `repository_dependencies.manifest_platform`        : package‑manager (NPM, NuGet, Maven, …) – must equal the platform of the library to count as a match  
• `repository_dependencies.repository_id`           : foreign‑key that lets us reach `repositories.id`  
• `repository_dependencies.repository_name_with_owner` : convenience if we only need repo slug without an extra join  
• `repositories.id`                                 : primary key, used to join back from dependency rows  
• `repositories.host_type`                          : GitHub / GitLab / Bitbucket – required output  
• `repositories.name_with_owner`                    : full repo slug – required output  
• `repositories.size`                               : repo size (kB) – multiply by 1024 to report bytes  
• `repositories.language`                           : primary language – required output  
• `repositories.fork_source_name_with_owner`        : original repo if this repo is a fork – required output  
• `repositories.updated_timestamp`                  : last update on Libraries.io side – required output  
• `repositories.stars_count`                        : useful for ranking popular matches (optional)  

Typical conditions  
• `dependency_project_name IN (…)` – match one of the artefact names in the feature‑toggle list  
• (optionally) `manifest_platform = 'npm'` (or `'NuGet'`, etc.) to tighten the match  
• `repositories.language IS NOT NULL`  – throw away repos with no detected language if desired  

Below are ten progressively more complex sample queries (every query returns at most 20 rows).  
Replace or extend the arrays in the `IN (…)` clauses with whichever feature‑toggle artefacts you care about.

```sql
-- 1. List distinct artefact names that appear in repository_dependencies
SELECT DISTINCT dependency_project_name
FROM `bigquery-public-data.libraries_io.repository_dependencies`
WHERE dependency_project_name IN ('unleash-client', 'ldclient-js', 'feature-toggles',
                                  'Unleash.FeatureToggle.Client', 'LaunchDarkly.Client')
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 2. Show one row per dependency match together with the repo slug
SELECT repository_name_with_owner, dependency_project_name, manifest_platform
FROM `bigquery-public-data.libraries_io.repository_dependencies`
WHERE dependency_project_name IN ('ldclient-js', 'ldclient-node')
  AND manifest_platform = 'npm'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 3. Join dependency rows to repositories and keep only GitHub repos
SELECT rd.repository_name_with_owner,
       r.host_type,
       rd.dependency_project_name
FROM   `bigquery-public-data.libraries_io.repository_dependencies` AS rd
JOIN   `bigquery-public-data.libraries_io.repositories`            AS r
ON     rd.repository_id = r.id
WHERE  rd.dependency_project_name = 'unleash-client'
  AND  rd.manifest_platform       = 'npm'
  AND  r.host_type                = 'GitHub'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 4. Same as #3 plus size in bytes and primary language
SELECT rd.repository_name_with_owner,
       r.host_type,
       r.size * 1024 AS size_bytes,
       r.language,
       rd.dependency_project_name
FROM   `bigquery-public-data.libraries_io.repository_dependencies` AS rd
JOIN   `bigquery-public-data.libraries_io.repositories`            AS r
ON     rd.repository_id = r.id
WHERE  rd.dependency_project_name IN ('unleash-client', 'ldclient-js')
  AND  rd.manifest_platform       = 'npm'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 5. Fuzzy name match: any dependency that CONTAINS 'launchdarkly'
SELECT DISTINCT dependency_project_name
FROM `bigquery-public-data.libraries_io.repository_dependencies`
WHERE LOWER(dependency_project_name) LIKE '%launchdarkly%'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 6. Top 20 repositories (by stars) that use any LaunchDarkly artefact
SELECT r.name_with_owner,
       r.stars_count,
       rd.dependency_project_name
FROM   `bigquery-public-data.libraries_io.repository_dependencies` AS rd
JOIN   `bigquery-public-data.libraries_io.repositories`            AS r
ON     rd.repository_id = r.id
WHERE  LOWER(rd.dependency_project_name) LIKE '%launchdarkly%'
ORDER  BY r.stars_count DESC
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 7. Count of repos per feature‑toggle artefact (all package managers)
SELECT rd.dependency_project_name,
       COUNT(DISTINCT rd.repository_id) AS repo_cnt
FROM   `bigquery-public-data.libraries_io.repository_dependencies` rd
WHERE  rd.dependency_project_name IN ('feature-toggles', 'gutter', 'fflip', 'rollout', 'Togglz')
GROUP  BY rd.dependency_project_name
ORDER  BY repo_cnt DESC
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 8. Most recently updated repositories that depend on Unleash libraries
SELECT r.name_with_owner,
       r.updated_timestamp,
       rd.dependency_project_name
FROM   `bigquery-public-data.libraries_io.repository_dependencies` rd
JOIN   `bigquery-public-data.libraries_io.repositories`            r
ON     rd.repository_id = r.id
WHERE  rd.dependency_project_name IN ('unleash-client', 'unleash-client-node',
                                      'unleash-client-go', 'unleash-client-dotnet')
ORDER  BY r.updated_timestamp DESC
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 9. All Go repositories that import toggle libraries (dcdr, toggle, unleash-client-go)
SELECT r.name_with_owner,
       r.language,
       rd.dependency_project_name,
       rd.manifest_platform
FROM   `bigquery-public-data.libraries_io.repository_dependencies` rd
JOIN   `bigquery-public-data.libraries_io.repositories`            r
ON     rd.repository_id = r.id
WHERE  rd.dependency_project_name IN ('github.com/vsco/dcdr', 'github.com/xchapter7x/toggle',
                                      'github.com/unleash/unleash-client-go')
  AND  r.language = 'Go'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 10. FINAL – deliver all requested columns, plus map artefact ➜ library & languages
SELECT
  r.name_with_owner                                   AS repo_full_name,
  r.host_type                                         AS repo_host,
  r.size * 1024                                       AS repo_size_bytes,
  r.language                                          AS repo_language,
  r.fork_source_name_with_owner                       AS fork_source,
  r.updated_timestamp                                 AS repo_last_update,
  rd.dependency_project_name                          AS artefact_name,
  CASE
      WHEN rd.dependency_project_name IN ('unleash-client', 'unleash-client-node',
                                          'unleash-client-go', 'unleash-client-dotnet')                 THEN 'Unleash'
      WHEN LOWER(rd.dependency_project_name) LIKE '%launchdarkly%'                                       THEN 'LaunchDarkly'
      WHEN rd.dependency_project_name IN ('feature-toggles', '@paralleldrive/react-feature-toggles')    THEN 'feature-toggles'
      WHEN rd.dependency_project_name IN ('fflip', 'flipit', '@flopflip/react-redux',
                                          '@flopflip/react-broadcast')                                  THEN 'Flipper family'
      WHEN rd.dependency_project_name IN ('gutter', 'django-waffle', 'gargoyle')                        THEN 'Gutter / Waffle / Gargoyle'
      ELSE 'Other feature‑toggle lib'
  END                                                AS library_name,
  CASE
      WHEN rd.manifest_platform = 'npm'      THEN 'JavaScript / TypeScript'
      WHEN rd.manifest_platform = 'NuGet'    THEN '.NET (C# / VB)'
      WHEN rd.manifest_platform = 'Maven'    THEN 'Java / Kotlin / Scala'
      WHEN rd.manifest_platform = 'Go'       THEN 'Go'
      WHEN rd.manifest_platform = 'Packagist'THEN 'PHP'
      WHEN rd.manifest_platform = 'Rubygems' THEN 'Ruby'
      WHEN rd.manifest_platform = 'Pypi'     THEN 'Python'
      ELSE 'unknown'
  END                                                AS library_languages
FROM   `bigquery-public-data.libraries_io.repository_dependencies` rd
JOIN   `bigquery-public-data.libraries_io.repositories`            r
ON     rd.repository_id = r.id
WHERE  rd.dependency_project_name IN (
         -- put all artefact names from your feature‑toggle list here
         'unleash-client', 'unleash-client-node', 'unleash-client-go', 'unleash-client-dotnet',
         'ldclient-js', 'ldclient-node', 'LaunchDarkly.Client', 'LaunchDarkly',
         'feature-toggles', '@paralleldrive/react-feature-toggles',
         'fflip', 'flipit', '@flopflip/react-redux', '@flopflip/react-broadcast',
         'gutter', 'django-waffle', 'gargoyle',
         'Togglz', 'FF4J', 'bandiera-client', 'bandiera-client-php',
         'rollout', 'opensoft/rollout', 'toggle', 'dcdr'  -- etc.
       )
LIMIT 20;
```

