Column name: repository_host_type Type: STRING Description: Which website the repository is hosted on, either GitHub, GitLab or Bitbucket.
Column name: repository_name_with_owner Type: STRING Description: The repository name and owner seperated by a slash, also maps to the url slug on the given repository host e.g. librariesio/libraries.io.
Column name: repository_description Type: STRING Description: Description of repository.
Column name: repository_fork Type: BOOL Description: Is the repository a fork of another.
Column name: repository_created_timestamp Type: TIMESTAMP Description: Timestamp of when the repository was created on the host.
Column name: repository_updated_timestamp Type: TIMESTAMP Description: Timestamp of when the repository was last saved by Libraries.io.
Column name: repository_last_pushed_timestamp Type: TIMESTAMP Description: Timestamp of when the repository was last pushed to, only available for GitHub repositories.
Column name: repository_homepage_url Type: STRING Description: URL of a declared homepage or other website for the repository.
Column name: repository_size Type: INT64 Description: Size of the repository in kilobytes, only available for GitHub and Bitbucket.
Column name: repository_stars_count Type: INT64 Description: Number of stars on the repository, only available for GitHub and GitLab.
Column name: repository_language Type: STRING Description: Primary programming language the project is written in, only available for GitHub and Bitbucket.
Column name: repository_issues_enabled Type: BOOL Description: Is the bug tracker enabled for this repository?.
Column name: repository_wiki_enabled Type: BOOL Description: Is the wiki enabled for this repository?.
Column name: repository_pages_enabled Type: BOOL Description: Is GitHub pages enabled for this repository? only possible for GitHub.
Column name: repository_forks_count Type: INT64 Description: Number of forks of this repository.
Column name: repository_mirror_url Type: STRING Description: URL of the repositroy of which this is a mirror of, only present if this repository is a mirror of another.
Column name: repository_open_issues_count Type: INT64 Description: Number of open issues on the repository bug tracker, only available for GitHub and GitLab.
Column name: repository_default_branch Type: STRING Description: Primary branch of the repository.
Column name: repository_watchers_count Type: INT64 Description: Number of subscribers to all notifications for the repository, only available for GitHub and Bitbucket.
Column name: repository_uuid Type: STRING Description: ID of the repository on the remote host, not unique between GitLab and GitHub repositories.
Column name: repository_fork_source_name_with_owner Type: STRING Description: If the repository is a fork, the repository name and owner seperated by a slash of the repository if was forked from.
Column name: repository_license Type: STRING Description: SPDX identifier of the license of the repository, only available for GitHub repositories.
Column name: repository_contributors_count Type: INT64 Description: Number of unique contributors that have committed to the default branch.
